From b0b14c4d444d1e8b909b919cad5dc90765e78b32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dpembo <dave@pembo.co.uk>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 05:57:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add LuckPerms-based warp limit enforcement

When a player's warp permission (axplayerwarps.warps.<n>) shrinks via a
LuckPerms rank change, or is found to have shrunk on join, remove their
most recently created warps down to their new limit. Oldest warps are
always kept. LuckPerms remains a soft dependency - the listener only
registers if the plugin is present.

Note: pom.xml is unchanged here - add the LuckPerms API dependency
(net.luckperms:api, provided scope) yourself if you haven't already.
